{"availability":"available","full":"natcat38/invoicely","name":"invoicely","description":"Maker-checker invoicing for small Singapore businesses — staff draft, owners approve. Java 25 / Spring Boot 4 API + React/TypeScript UI, GST-aware BigDecimal money, live demo with seeded data.","category":"Design","language":"Java","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-28T10:21:10Z","updated":"2026-10-01T21:09:36Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://invoicely-loo1.onrender.com","topics":["flyway","invoicing","java","jwt","postgresql","react","singapore","spring-boot","tailwindcss","typescript"],"demo":"https://invoicely-loo1.onrender.com/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:30.278Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:30.278Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:30.278Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T22:39:30.278Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Invoicing for a small Singapore business with more than one person touching money.","Staff draft invoices; only the owner approves, sends, and records payments — a maker-checker split enforced by the API, not just the UI. Invoices carry GST at Singapore's rate when the business is GST-registered, track payments against a running balance, and move through a fixed lifecycle (DRAFT → PENDINGAPPROVAL → SENT → OVERDUE → PAID). The owner gets a dashboard of what's outstanding, overdue, and earned this month.","Live demo: invoicely-loo1.onrender.com — log in as owner@invoicely.demo or staff@invoicely.demo, password invoicely-demo-2026. It runs on a free instance that sleeps when idle, so the first page load can take about 30 seconds while the API wakes; everything after that is instant. The five-minute tour below is the fastest way through it."],"features":["Two people, two roles, one document. Staff draft, the owner approves and","Money that has to agree with itself. BigDecimal throughout, rounded in","A document, not a form. The invoice a client receives is a designed"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/natcat38/invoicely/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"ed9844f1a8c33bf3a8b597150588794cd40abcb7e0a0a356b299cf3a9396c1b2","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:30.468Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:30.468Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Invoicing for a small Singapore business with more than one person touching money.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/natcat38/invoicely/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"> Live demo: invoicely-loo1.onrender.com — > log in as owner@invoicely.demo or staff@invoicely.demo, password > invoicely-demo-2026.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/natcat38/invoicely/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Sign in as the owner.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/natcat38/invoicely/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"ed9844f1a8c33bf3a8b597150588794cd40abcb7e0a0a356b299cf3a9396c1b2","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/natcat38/invoicely/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:30.468Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-01T21:09:36Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/natcat38/invoicely/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:30.471Z","hash":"ed9844f1a8c33bf3a8b597150588794cd40abcb7e0a0a356b299cf3a9396c1b2","originalBytes":22797,"storedBytes":22797,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["docs","invoices","adr","api","invoice","invoicely","one","owner","password","spring","web","demo","gst","business","only","java","security","staff","two","every","get","role","auth","lifecycle","payments","post","run","what","clients","document","domain","rather","same","token","any","app","dashboard","live","npm","overdue","postgresql","rate","status","url","already","approval","build","builder","change","checks","docker","it.","jwt","login","money","render","because","com","data","database","draft","each","flyway","main","maker-checker",